chapter.v:
He reigned 


for three, 


years in Jerusalem. His mother’s name was Micaiah(1) the daughter of Uriel of Gibeah. Now there was war between Abijah and Jeroboam.

But as 


for us,, 


the LORD is our God, and we have not forsaken him. We have priests ministering to the LORD who are sons of Aaron, and Levites for their service.
